@startuml F1.9-D07-gerar-protocolo
title F1.9-D07 — Gerar protocolo PDF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ProtocolUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres
participant "MinIO" as MinIO

Aluno -> WebApp: Gerar protocolo
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests/{id}/protocol
Jwt -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT solicitação
Postgres --> UC: dados
UC -> MinIO: armazena PDF + QR
MinIO --> UC: OK
UC -> Postgres: registra protocolo
UC --> WebApp: 200 + downloadUrl\n(presigned 15 min)
WebApp --> Aluno: download direto

@enduml
